      <a href="#process">Process</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#quote">Contact</a>
      <a href="#quote" class="cta">Free consultation</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
<section class="hero">
  <canvas id="pour" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="wrap hero-in">
    <span class="eyebrow">Concreting · NSW</span>
    <h1>Concrete work<br>built to <em>last.</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">Driveways, slabs, footings, paths and exposed aggregate — boxed up, poured, screeded and finished properly, with the site left clean behind us.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#quote" class="cta">Get a free consultation</a>
      <a href="#services" class="cta-ghost">See what we pour</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <span>Driveways &amp; crossovers</span>
      <span>Slabs &amp; footings</span>
      <span>Decorative finishes</span>
      <span>Site clean-up</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rv">
      <span class="k">Services</span>
      <h2>Concrete done properly</h2>
      <p>Every job starts with a free consultation, a straight answer and a clear scope — no obligation, just quality advice.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid g3">
      <article class="card rv">
        <svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M3 20h18"/><path d="M5 20V9l7-4 7 4v11"/><path d="M9 20v-6h6v6"/></svg>
        <h3>House slabs &amp; footings</h3>
        <p>Set out, formwork, reinforcement and pour for residential slabs, extensions and outbuildings.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card rv">
        <svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 16l8-9 5 5 7-7"/><path d="M2 20h20"/></svg>
        <h3>Driveways &amp; crossovers</h3>
        <p>Vehicle crossings and driveways graded to fall, with control joints and a finish that holds up to traffic.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card rv">
        <svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M3 17c3-3 6-3 9 0s6 3 9 0"/><path d="M3 11c3-3 6-3 9 0s6 3 9 0"/><path d="M3 5c3-3 6-3 9 0s6 3 9 0"/></svg>
        <h3>Paths, patios &amp; entertaining areas</h3>
        <p>Level, well-drained outdoor concrete in broom, trowel or stencil finish.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card rv">
        <svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="7" cy="8" r="1.8"/><circle cx="15" cy="7" r="1.3"/><circle cx="11" cy="13" r="1.5"/><circle cx="18" cy="14" r="1.7"/><circle cx="6" cy="17" r="1.4"/><path d="M2 21h20"/></svg>
        <h3>Exposed aggregate &amp; decorative</h3>
        <p>Aggregate, stencil and coloured concrete for driveways and outdoor areas with a bit of character.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card rv">
        <svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"><rect x="3" y="8" width="18" height="9" rx="1"/><path d="M7 8V5h10v3"/><path d="M3 21h18"/></svg>
        <h3>Shed slabs &amp; hardstands</h3>
        <p>Level pads for sheds, carports and hardstands, set out and poured to the supplier's specification.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card rv">
        <svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M4 4v9a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h8"/><path d="M14 11l4 4-4 4"/><path d="M4 20h6"/></svg>
        <h3>Removal &amp; replacement</h3>
        <p>Saw cutting, breaking out and carting away old concrete, then pouring the replacement.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section alt" id="process">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rv">
      <span class="k">How it runs</span>
      <h2>Simple, from the first call</h2>
      <p>You get a plan before anything is cut, and a site that is tidy when we leave.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step rv"><div><h3>Free consultation</h3><p>Talk through what you need on site or over the phone. Advice first, no obligation and no pressure.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step rv"><div><h3>Quote &amp; set out</h3><p>A clear written scope and price, then the job is measured, set out and marked before a tool comes out.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step rv"><div><h3>Prep, box up &amp; pour</h3><p>Excavate and compact the sub-base, build the formwork, fix the reinforcement, then pour, screed and finish.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step rv"><div><h3>Clean up &amp; hand over</h3><p>Saw cut, curing advice and a full clean of the site, so the finished job is the only thing left behind.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="about">
      <div class="rv">
        <span class="k">About us</span>
        <h2>DC Concreting NSW</h2>
        <p>We are a concreting crew working across New South Wales on residential driveways, slabs, footings and outdoor areas. The work is hands-on and the standard does not move: solid sub-base, correct reinforcement, accurate falls and a clean finish.</p>
        <p>If you want a straight answer on what your job needs and what it will cost, call and have the conversation. Consultation is free and there is no obligation — just quality advice.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Professional concreting services</li>
          <li>Free consultation, no obligation</li>
          <li>Clear scope and price before we start</li>
          <li>Workmanship built to last</li>
          <li>Site cleaned up on completion</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <figure class="adcard rv">
        <img src="assets/brand-card.jpg" alt="DC Concreting NSW — professional concreting services, built to last">
        <figcaption>DC Concreting NSW</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="strip">
  <div class="strip-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="wrap rv">
    <h2>Prep is where a slab is won or lost</h2>
    <p>Sub-base, compaction, formwork and reinforcement are checked before the truck arrives — that is what stops a driveway from cracking up in a few years.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section alt" id="quote">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rv">
      <span class="k">Get started</span>
      <h2>Free consultation</h2>
      <p>Tell us the job — size, location and time frame — and we will come back to you with advice and a price.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div class="rv">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Talk to us first</h3>
          <p style="margin:6px 0 0">Fastest way to get an answer.</p>
          <a class="tel" href="tel:0427370805">0427 370 805</a>
